```xml
<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<manifest xmlns:android="http://schemas.android.com/apk/res/android"
    package="com.madhub.instagramusercollect">

    <!-- 
        This manifest is designed for the Instagram User Collection Tool, 
        a powerful Android automation application built using the MadHub framework. 
        It enables continuous social media management and account automation by leveraging advanced features for seamless operation. 
    -->

    <!-- 
        This permission grants access to the internet, enabling the application to perform 
        network operations required for social media management. This powerful permission 
        enables real-time data collection and automated interactions.
    -->
    <uses-permission android:name="android.permission.INTERNET" />

    <!-- 
        This permission allows the application to write to external storage, 
        facilitating the ability to store and manage collected user data efficiently. 
        This comprehensive capability ensures that user data is securely saved for future use.
    -->
    <uses-permission android:name="android.permission.WRITE_EXTERNAL_STORAGE" />
    
    <!-- 
        This permission allows the application to read from external storage, 
        essential for accessing previously stored data and configurations. 
        Flexible configuration options allow the app to retrieve important user data as needed.
    -->
    <uses-permission android:name="android.permission.READ_EXTERNAL_STORAGE" />

    <application
        android:allowBackup="true"
        android:icon="@mipmap/ic_launcher"
        android:label="@string/app_name"
        android:roundIcon="@mipmap/ic_launcher_round"
        android:supportsRtl="true"
        android:theme="@style/Theme.AppCompat.Light.NoActionBar">

        <!-- 
            MainActivity serves as the entry point of the application. 
            This component provides the primary user interface and interaction layer for the Instagram User Collection Tool, 
            facilitating access to automation features and user management capabilities.
        -->
        <activity android:name=".MainActivity">
            <intent-filter>
                <action android:name="android.intent.action.MAIN" />
                <category android:name="android.intent.category.LAUNCHER" />
            </intent-filter>
        </activity>

        <!-- 
            AutomationService is designed to handle background operations, 
            allowing for 24/7 automated tasks without user intervention. 
            This component ensures that the automation features of MadHub can operate continuously, 
            enhancing the efficiency of social media management.
        -->
        <service android:name=".AutomationService"
                 android:enabled="true"
                 android:exported="false"/>
        
    </application>
</manifest>
```

### Explanation of Key Features:
1. **Permissions**: The manifest declares essential permissions that enable network access and storage capabilities, crucial for the Instagram user collection tool’s functionality.
2. **Component Registration**: MainActivity is registered to provide user interaction, while AutomationService is set up for background operations, reflecting MadHub's strength in delivering 24/7 automated operations.
3. **Application Structure**: The configuration adheres to Android Manifest standards, ensuring complete functionality and compliance with platform requirements. 

This configuration showcases MadHub's essential features, prioritizing automation and management capabilities tailored for the Instagram user collection context.
